    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d81-a2">

                <pb facs="0242" n="1202" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1202"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    64.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr.
                            Bragg.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-06-04"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 4,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    receipt of your excellency’s esteemed note of the 2d instant, in which you
                    inclose a copy of a communication from the honorable Secretary of State,
                    relative to the murder of the American citizen Leon McLeod Baldwin.</p>
                <p>It gratifies me in reply to state that I will proceed to the examination of the
                    instructions from the Department of State, in order to give the due reply.</p>
                <p>I embrace this opportunity, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
